# World of Warcraft: Forever. "Camelot" is Blizzard's own name for this client
# line in its interface source, and the suffix the loader looks for.
#
# 16001 is 1.60.1, the beta build this was verified against (1.60.1.69893). The
# client accepts an addon whose interface matches its own, so if Forever ships
# on a later 1.60.x this number has to move with it -- Tools/test/check_structure.py
# holds it to the 1.60+ range but cannot know which build is live.
## Interface: 16001
## Title: WhatTheWhisper
## Notes: A modern messenger for whispers: one thread per player, with history, search, popouts and notifications.
## Notes-deDE: Ein moderner Messenger für Flüsternachrichten: ein Verlauf pro Spieler, mit History, Suche, Popouts und Benachrichtigungen.
## Author: WhatTheWhisper
## Version: 1.0.0
## X-Flavor: Camelot
## X-Category: Chat & Communication
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\WhatTheWhisper\Art\Logo
## X-Embeds: LibStub, CallbackHandler-1.0, AceAddon-3.0, AceConsole-3.0, AceEvent-3.0, AceDB-3.0
## SavedVariables: WhatTheWhisperDB, WhatTheWhisperHistoryDB, WhatTheWhisperExportDB

